{"id": "ecosystem-study", "status": "published", "category": "研究方向", "title": "產業生態系研究", "subtitle": "一位深耕亞利桑那產業第一線的前輩，分享了他理解產業生態系的結構框架。", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-ecosystem-study.png", "width": 1348, "height": 472, "scale": 1, "fit": "contain", "background": "#ffffff", "srcset": "/assets/responsive/cover-ecosystem-study-2650ffa02096-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/cover-ecosystem-study-2650ffa02096-960.webp 960w"}, "html": "<div class=\"note-brief\"><p class=\"note-attribution\">架構來源：<span>亞利桑那貿易投資處處長</span> <a href=\"https://bme.engineering.arizona.edu/person/steve-hsu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">徐竹先<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> ↗</span></a></p><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>為什麼重要：</h3><p>這個框架讓我學習從企業之間的連結出發，看見政策、基礎建設、供應鏈與專業服務如何相互支撐，讓一項投資逐步落地，也進一步理解產業聚落形成所需要的條件。</p><p>感謝前輩分享實務累積的觀察，讓我有機會從單一企業的視角，走向對整體產業生態系的理解。</p></section><div class=\"note-resources\"><a href=\"https://arizona-jp-tw-map.jarvislintggc.chatgpt.site/ecosystem-network?lang=zh-tw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">開啟 Ecosystem Network<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> ↗</span></a></div></div>", "pending": "完整文章準備中。", "close": "關閉"}